[background arg="res://assets/Scene_Overlay.png" fade="0.0"]
audio music "res://audio/Music/Love Song.mp3" [volume="-15.0"]
join Dagger (Close Up) leftmost [animation="Instant In" mirrored="true"]
join Lizzy (Close Up) righter [animation="Bounce In"]
Dagger: Lizzy… a serendipitous entrance...
update Dagger left [length="0.8" move_time="1.5"]
Dagger: I was just observing the epitaphs on the tombstones--
Lizzy: Yes, yes I know, I know.
Lizzy: Death is the thing that separates loved ones, yadda yadda.
Dagger: ...
Dagger: You seem somewhat perturbed.
Lizzy: I’ve had to relive the same day like four times, so yeah, I’m a little annoyed.
Lizzy: like the first time we had this conversation I felt a little bad, but now I’m like, whatever.
Dagger: Being an immortal often feels as though you are stuck in a certain time.
For me, I still feel as the day I was turned, eighteen and directionless--
Lizzy: I’m just going to go, I don’t know why I came here.
Dagger: If that’s how you feel...
update Dagger [mirrored="false"]
Dagger: Farewell.
leave Dagger [animation="Fade Out"]

do GameState.mark_characters_as_spoken(["dagger"])